---
import { MILESTONES } from '../../data/milestones';
import { FORMULAS } from '../../data/formulas';
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale = 'es' } = Astro.props;
const milestone = MILESTONES[8];
const spigot = FORMULAS.dikWinterSpigot;
const circularCode = `                 #include <stdio.h>
               int a=10000,b,c=2800,d,e,
             f[2801],g;main(){for(;b-c;)f[b++]=
            a/5;for(;d=0,g=c*2;c-=14,printf("%.4d",
           e+d/a),e=d%a)for(b=c;d+=f[b]*a,f[b]=d%--g,
          d/=g--,--b;d*=b);} /* Spigot Pi Algorithm */`;
---

<section 
  id="scene-9" 
  class="scene" 
  data-scene="cyber" 
  data-year={milestone.year}
  data-pi-value={milestone.precisionValue}
  data-theme={milestone.theme}
  data-scene-title={milestone.title[locale]}
>
  <div class="stage" id="spigot-stage">
    <!-- Inner Content: Split Architecture (Feynman Left, Circular C IDE Right) -->
    <div class="stage-content layout-split">
      <!-- Left Column: Feynman Point Monumental Callout -->
      <div class="feynman-col choreo-header">
        <div class="museum-plate">
          [ FIG. 09 // AMSTERDAM, 1988 — IOCCC WINNER // SPIGOT BASE MIXTA ]
        </div>

        <div class="narrative-layer">
          <div class="beat beat-1" data-beat="0.00-0.40">
            <span class="scene-kicker">09 // PASADENA Y AMSTERDAM · CULTO HACKER</span>
            <h2 class="scene-title">{milestone.title[locale]}</h2>
            <p class="beat-text">
              {locale === 'es'
                ? 'Dos joyas de la mitología computacional. Primero, Richard Feynman bromearía con memorizar π hasta la posición 762 solo para recitar: «nueve, nueve, nueve, nueve, nueve, nueve... y así sucesivamente», fingiendo que π era un número racional.'
                : 'Two icons of computational mythology. First, Richard Feynman quipped he would memorize π to index 762 simply to recite: «nine, nine, nine, nine, nine, nine... and so on», pretending π was a rational periodic fraction.'}
            </p>

            <!-- Monumental Feynman 999999 Callout Box -->
            <div class="feynman-card blueprint-panel" style="margin-top: 14px;">
              <span class="feynman-badge">PUNTO DE FEYNMAN · DECIMAL #762</span>
              <div class="feynman-digits-monument tabular" id="feynman-cluster">
                999999
              </div>
              <p class="feynman-footnote">
                {locale === 'es'
                  ? 'Seis nueves consecutivos a partir de la posición 762. La probabilidad de que ocurra al azar tan temprano es de apenas 0.08%.'
                  : 'Six consecutive nines starting at position 762. The probability of this random run appearing so early is a mere 0.08%.'}
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="beat beat-2" data-beat="0.38-0.78">
            <span class="scene-kicker">09 // EL CÓDIGO CIRCULAR DE 160 CARACTERES</span>
            <h2 class="scene-title">El Grifo (Spigot) de Dik Winter</h2>
            <p class="beat-text">
              {locale === 'es'
                ? 'En 1997, Dik Winter y Achim Flammenkamp ganaron el concurso IOCCC con 160 caracteres en C formateados con la silueta de un círculo. Cero decimales flotantes: solo aritmética entera en base mixta que gotea dígitos de 4 en 4.'
                : 'In 1997, Dik Winter and Achim Flammenkamp won the IOCCC contest with 160 characters formatted into the geometry of a circle. Zero floating-point: pure mixed-radix integer arithmetic dripping digits 4 by 4.'}
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="beat beat-climax" data-beat="0.75-1.00">
            <blockquote class="hacker-quote">
              <p>«El código se convirtió en la geometría misma de lo que calcula.»</p>
              <cite>— Dik T. Winter &amp; Richard Feynman</cite>
            </blockquote>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: GitHub / IDE Visualizer Window with Circular C Code -->
      <div class="ide-col choreo-artifact" id="hacker-stage">
        <div class="github-window blueprint-panel">
          <!-- Window Top Bar (macOS Lights + Tab) -->
          <div class="window-bar">
            <div class="window-lights">
              <span class="light light-red"></span>
              <span class="light light-yellow"></span>
              <span class="light light-green"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="window-tab">dik_winter_pi_circle.c</span>
            <span class="window-badge" id="term-status">IOCCC 1997 · READY</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Editor Body with Circular Code -->
          <div class="code-viewport">
            <pre class="circle-c-pre"><code>{circularCode}</code></pre>

            <!-- Live Output Stream Terminal Line -->
            <div class="terminal-stream-box">
              <span class="term-prompt">$ ./pi_circle &gt;</span>
              <span class="stream-output tabular" id="spigot-output">3141 5926 5358 9793 2384 6264 3383...</span>
              <span class="term-cursor">█</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Controls Toolbar -->
          <div class="terminal-toolbar choreo-metrics">
            <button type="button" id="btn-run-spigot" class="ide-btn ide-btn-primary" title="Iniciar goteo del algoritmo">
              <span>▶ GOTEAR DÍGITOS</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" id="btn-feynman-highlight" class="ide-btn ide-btn-amber" title="Destacar punto de Feynman">
              <span>⚡ FEYNMAN #762</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" id="btn-reset-spigot" class="ide-btn ide-btn-dim" title="Reiniciar salida">
              <span>↺ REINICIAR</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { soundEngine } from '../../scripts/audio';

  const hackerStage = document.getElementById('hacker-stage');
  const spigotOutput = document.getElementById('spigot-output');
  const termStatus = document.getElementById('term-status');
  const runBtn = document.getElementById('btn-run-spigot');
  const feynmanBtn = document.getElementById('btn-feynman-highlight');
  const resetBtn = document.getElementById('btn-reset-spigot');
  const feynmanCluster = document.getElementById('feynman-cluster');
  const scene = document.getElementById('scene-9');

  const fullStream = '';

  let dripIndex = 32;
  let dripInterval: ReturnType<typeof setInterval> | null = null;

  function renderDrip() {
    if (!spigotOutput) return;
    const chunk = fullStream.slice(0, dripIndex);
    const formatted = chunk.replace(/(.{4})/g, '$1 ').trim();
    spigotOutput.textContent = formatted;
  }

  function startDrip() {
    if (dripInterval) return;
    if (termStatus) termStatus.textContent = 'RUNNING...';
    dripInterval = setInterval(() => {
      dripIndex += 4;
      if (dripIndex > fullStream.length) {
        dripIndex = fullStream.length;
        if (dripInterval) clearInterval(dripInterval);
        dripInterval = null;
        if (termStatus) termStatus.textContent = 'COMPLETED';
      }
      renderDrip();
      soundEngine.playDigit(dripIndex % 10);
    }, 120);
  }

  function resetDrip() {
    if (dripInterval) {
      clearInterval(dripInterval);
      dripInterval = null;
    }
    dripIndex = 32;
    renderDrip();
    if (termStatus) termStatus.textContent = 'READY';
  }

  runBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    startDrip();
  });

  resetBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    resetDrip();
  });

  if (scene) {
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      const p = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(scene).getPropertyValue('--p')) || 0;
      if (p > 0.45 && !dripInterval && dripIndex <= 32) {
        startDrip();
      }
      if (p > 0.65 && feynmanCluster) {
        feynmanCluster.classList.add('is-pulse');
      }
    }, { passive: true });
  }

  feynmanBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    feynmanCluster?.classList.toggle('is-pulse');
    soundEngine.playFeynmanResolution();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .scene {
    height: 380vh;
    position: relative;
    --p: 0;
  }

  #spigot-stage {
    background: #002fa7 !important; /* Engineering Klein Blue */
    color: #ffffff !important;
  }

  .feynman-col {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 520px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .feynman-col .museum-plate {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    color: #94b9ff;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .scene-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #00f0ff;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .scene-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .beat-text {
    font-family: var(--font-editorial);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.7vw, 1.08rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Monumental Feynman Box */
  .feynman-card {
    background: rgba(0, 20, 80, 0.7) !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.5) !important;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .feynman-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: #00f0ff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .feynman-digits-monument {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffd700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 1;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.6);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .feynman-digits-monument.is-pulse {
    color: #00f0ff;
    text-shadow: 0 0 35px #00f0ff, 0 0 70px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6);
    transform: scale(1.04);
  }

  .feynman-footnote {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hacker-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.4vw, 1.7rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: #00f0ff;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .hacker-quote cite {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-style: normal;
    color: #94b9ff;
    margin-top: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /* Right Column: GitHub / IDE Visualizer Window */
  .ide-col {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 660px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .github-window {
    width: 100%;
    background: #090e18 !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35) !important;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 25px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15) !important;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .window-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    background: #060910;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .window-lights {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .light {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .light-red { background: #ff5f56; }
  .light-yellow { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .light-green { background: #27c93f; }

  .window-tab {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #94b9ff;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .window-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #00f0ff;
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .code-viewport {
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: #04070d;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .circle-c-pre {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 1.25vw, 0.88rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: #38bdf8;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .terminal-stream-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .term-prompt {
    color: #00f0ff;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .stream-output {
    color: #ffd700;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .term-cursor {
    color: #00f0ff;
    animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
  }

  @keyframes blink {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0; }
  }

  .terminal-toolbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    background: #060910;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .ide-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ide-btn-primary {
    background: #00f0ff;
    color: #000;
  }

  .ide-btn-primary:hover {
    background: #38bdf8;
    transform: scale(1.04);
  }

  .ide-btn-amber {
    background: #ffd700;
    color: #000;
  }

  .ide-btn-amber:hover {
    background: #facc15;
    transform: scale(1.04);
  }

  .ide-btn-dim {
    background: transparent;
    color: #94b9ff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 185, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .ide-btn-dim:hover {
    background: rgba(148, 185, 255, 0.1);
    color: #fff;
  }
</style>
